
# api call for create admin accounts

###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/admin/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"adminuser",
    "email":"admin@gmail.com",
    "password":"admin@123",
    "phone":"5498765433"
}

# api call for  create student account

###
