{
    "username":"student_01",
    "email":"student@gmail.com",
    "password":"student@123",
    "phone":"9876568463"
}


#api call for token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"adminuser",
    "password":"admin@123"
}

